OL,3,AAnthropic valued at $1.5 trillion ahead
OL,4,Aof AI giant's stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic will be valued at $1.5tn
OL,7,F(#1.14tn) when the five-year-old AI
OL,8,Ffirm makes its stock market debut on
OL,9,FThursday, becoming one of the most
OL,10,Fvaluable companies in the world.
OL,12,FThe firm behind the chatbot Claude said
OL,13,Fits shares will be priced at $83 when
OL,14,Fit lists on the Nasdaq, a tech-focused
OL,15,Fstock exchange based in New York.
OL,17,FAnthropic's flotation will make it the
OL,18,Ffirst US firm focused exclusively on AI
OL,19,Fto go public. The seven founders, who
OL,20,Fset the business up in 2021, will
OL,21,Fbecome multi-billionaires.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
